            <h1 class="section-title">Feeder protection and control REF615</h1>
            <p>REF615 has been designed to protect overhead line and cable feeders in utility and industrial power distribution systems, including radial, looped and meshed distribution networks, with or without distributed power generation.</p>
        </div>
