                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>REF615 has been designed to be the main overcurrent and earth-fault protection for overhead lines and cable feeders in either radial, looped or meshed distribution networks, depending on the standard configuration.</td>
                        <td>&bull;</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>REF615 is available in twelve standard configurations. In addition to standard configurations, N L also provides maximum flexibility to allow fully flexible tailoring. The major difference is that L includes support for three-corps sensors (Rogowski coil) and voltages (voltage divider), whereas N supports conventional current and voltage instrument transformers.</td>
