                <div class="column">
                    <p>The extensive earth-fault protection portfolio has been expanded to include a unique multi-frequency admittance-based protection for higher sensitivity and selectivity. The new earth-fault protection is intended for all types of earth faults – continuous, transient and intermittent – and combines both reliability and sensitivity in one function.</p>
                    <p>REF615 includes fault locator which calculates the location of earth faults in radial distribution networks and earth faults in effectively low-resistance earth faults. If the fault current is as high as 100A, the fault location is accurate to within 10m. REF615 can be equipped with high-speed outputs for fault location, which can be triggered within milliseconds compared to conventional binary outputs.</p>
                    <p>To further ensure grid stability and reliability, an interconnection protection package is introduced. Other additions include high-impedance differential protection with CT supervision, switch on to fault, reverse power/directional overpower protection and voltage imbalance protection to further strengthen the system's reliability.</p>
                </div>
